{"title":"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the 2013 Winnebago County Fair a vendor is offering a \"fair special\" on sandals. If you buy one pair of sandals at the regular price of \\$50, you get a second pair at a 40% discount, and a third pair at half the regular price. Javier took advantage of the \"fair special\" to buy three pairs of sandals. What percentage of the \\$150 regular price did he save?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/e/cfeb315b0347c105031943399bc0f5f7b95de7d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 25 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 33 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 40 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, find the amount of money one will pay for three sandals without the discount. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/becd84a930e394cedb226e6a033c0c53773f121a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 50\\times 3 \\text{ sandals} = \\textdollar 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"176\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Then, find the amount of money using the discount: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a3c774534d0f29984bc03d6f84913e1699c450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 + 0.6 \\times 50 + \\frac{1}{2} \\times 50 = \\textdollar 105$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"239\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Finding the percentage yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/a/57a63ea9648793a15a8754fa1558671e2359bd5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{105}{150} = 70 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>To find the percent saved, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/4/fa48c80d8841af12c644c4b77b4b3758a4be99de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\% -70 \\%= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 30 \\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"203\" height=\"31\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Step 1: Find the price of each sandal\nThe first sandal is 50 dollars.\nThe second sandal is (1-0.4)50 = 30\nThe third sandal is 1/2*5$ = 25\nStep 2: Sum them up\n50+30+25 = 105\nStep 2: Divide by 150\n105/150 = 21/30 = 7/10 = 70 percent.\nStep 3: Subtract from 100 percent to find the amount he saved.\n100 percent -70 percent = B)30 percent\n</p><p><br />\n-JasonDaGoat\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VQPKh5hc3xY\">https://youtu.be/VQPKh5hc3xY</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 8\">2013 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2013\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Proble